{"id":"huntik:page:2004","page_id":2004,"title":"Hyperstride","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Hyperstride is a basic spell and considered to be mandatory for Seekers. The spell increases the casters speed and agility allowing them to run quickly for escapes and to strike quickly while in combat. As a result, this spell can also increase the distance that the caster can jump. The spell manifests itself as a blue aura that surrounds the casters legs.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S1E17_Lok_Hyperstride.png","wikitext":"File:S1E17_Lok_Hyperstride.png","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Blue","wikitext":"Blue","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Mobility","wikitext":"Mobility","links":[]},"users":{"text":"Casterwill family\nHuntik Foundation\nSuits\nWind","wikitext":"[[Casterwill family]]<br> [[Huntik Foundation]]<br>[[Suits]]<br>[[Wind]]","links":[{"target_title":"Casterwill family","label":"Casterwill family","target_id":"huntik:page:3280","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_family","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3280"},{"target_title":"Huntik Foundation","label":"Huntik Foundation","target_id":"huntik:page:1987","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Huntik_Foundation","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1987"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Wind","label":"Wind","target_id":"huntik:page:3456","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Wind","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3456"}]},"first":{"text":"\"A Seeker Is Born\"","wikitext":"\"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_id":"huntik:page:2257","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"}]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:S1E17_Lok_Hyperstride.png","value_text":"File:S1E17_Lok_Hyperstride.png","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Blue","value_text":"Blue","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Mobility","value_text":"Mobility","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[Casterwill family]]<br> [[Huntik Foundation]]<br>[[Suits]]<br>[[Wind]]","value_text":"Casterwill family\nHuntik Foundation\nSuits\nWind","links":[{"target_title":"Casterwill family","label":"Casterwill family","target_id":"huntik:page:3280","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_family","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3280"},{"target_title":"Huntik Foundation","label":"Huntik Foundation","target_id":"huntik:page:1987","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Huntik_Foundation","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1987"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Wind","label":"Wind","target_id":"huntik:page:3456","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Wind","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3456"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"","value_text":"\"A Seeker Is Born\"","links":[{"target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_id":"huntik:page:2257","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"}]}],"start":0,"end":209}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"This spell was cast silently by [[DeFoe|DeFoe's]] [[Suits]] as they chased after [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] in the streets of [[Venice, Italy]]. [[Dante Vale]] later silently cast this spell in the courtyard of his [[Dante Vale's house|house]] before invoking [[Caliban]]. {{source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nDante used this spell whilst carrying Lok on the rooftops of his [[Dante Vale's house|house]] during their escape from [[The Organization]]. The [[Suits]] followed suite, using Hyperstride to leap from roof to roof in pursuit of the pair. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}\n\nLok learnt the spell whilst climbing the walls of the [[Cathedral of Notre Dame]] but did not use enough energy and nearly fell. Luckily Dante caught him. Later, he succeeded in using the spell to dodge an attack from the [[Knights of Arc's Inner Circle]]. {{source|Crawling the Catacombs}} \n\n[[Focauld Casterwill]] used this spell in the [[Cloisters]] to escape into the darkness and hide from [[Kiel]], [[Marduk]] and the [[Blood Spiral]] [[Casterwill Hunters]]. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n\nThis spell was cast by [[Dante Vale]] on his [[Caliban]] to help push the boat. {{source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}","text":"This spell was cast silently by DeFoe's Suits as they chased after Lok Lambert and Sophie Casterwill in the streets of Venice, Italy. Dante Vale later silently cast this spell in the courtyard of his house before invoking Caliban. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nDante used this spell whilst carrying Lok on the rooftops of his house during their escape from The Organization. The Suits followed suite, using Hyperstride to leap from roof to roof in pursuit of the pair. [The Casterwill Client]\n\nLok learnt the spell whilst climbing the walls of the Cathedral of Notre Dame but did not use enough energy and nearly fell. Luckily Dante caught him. Later, he succeeded in using the spell to dodge an attack from the Knights of Arc's Inner Circle. [Crawling the Catacombs]\n\nFocauld Casterwill used this spell in the Cloisters to escape into the darkness and hide from Kiel, Marduk and the Blood Spiral Casterwill Hunters. [The Casterwill Connection]\n\nThis spell was cast by Dante Vale on his Caliban to help push the boat. [Like Father, Unlike Son]"},{"heading":"Users","level":2,"wikitext":"*[[Dante Vale]]\n*[[Dellix]]\n*[[Den Fears]]\n*[[Focauld Casterwill]]\n*[[Lok Lambert]] \n*[[Lane]]\n*[[Lucas Casterwill]]\n*[[Santiago]]\n*[[Sophie Casterwill]]\n*[[Suits]]\n*[[Viktor Casterwill]]\n*[[Wind]]\n*[[Zhalia Moon]]\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"• Dante Vale\n• Dellix\n• Den Fears\n• Focauld Casterwill\n• Lok Lambert\n• Lane\n• Lucas Casterwill\n• Santiago\n• Sophie Casterwill\n• Suits\n• Viktor Casterwill\n• Wind\n• Zhalia Moon"},{"heading":"Trivia","level":2,"wikitext":"* On the [[TCG:SAS-110|Hyperstride]] card, Dante's legs are covered in a fiery orange aura instead of blue as seen in the show.","text":"• On the Hyperstride card, Dante's legs are covered in a fiery orange aura instead of blue as seen in the show."},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|DUT= Hypersprong\n|FR = Hyper-saut\n|POR = Hiper-salto\n}}\n\n\n[[nl:Hypersprong]]\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Mobility spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family magic]]","text":"Dutch: Hypersprong\nFrench: Hyper-saut\nPortuguese: Hiper-salto\n\nnl:Hypersprong"}],"full_text":"Hyperstride is a basic spell and considered to be mandatory for Seekers. The spell increases the casters speed and agility allowing them to run quickly for escapes and to strike quickly while in combat. As a result, this spell can also increase the distance that the caster can jump. The spell manifests itself as a blue aura that surrounds the casters legs.\n\nHistory\n\nThis spell was cast silently by DeFoe's Suits as they chased after Lok Lambert and Sophie Casterwill in the streets of Venice, Italy. Dante Vale later silently cast this spell in the courtyard of his house before invoking Caliban. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nDante used this spell whilst carrying Lok on the rooftops of his house during their escape from The Organization. The Suits followed suite, using Hyperstride to leap from roof to roof in pursuit of the pair. [The Casterwill Client]\n\nLok learnt the spell whilst climbing the walls of the Cathedral of Notre Dame but did not use enough energy and nearly fell. Luckily Dante caught him. Later, he succeeded in using the spell to dodge an attack from the Knights of Arc's Inner Circle. [Crawling the Catacombs]\n\nFocauld Casterwill used this spell in the Cloisters to escape into the darkness and hide from Kiel, Marduk and the Blood Spiral Casterwill Hunters. [The Casterwill Connection]\n\nThis spell was cast by Dante Vale on his Caliban to help push the boat. [Like Father, Unlike Son]\n\nUsers\n\n• Dante Vale\n• Dellix\n• Den Fears\n• Focauld Casterwill\n• Lok Lambert\n• Lane\n• Lucas Casterwill\n• Santiago\n• Sophie Casterwill\n• Suits\n• Viktor Casterwill\n• Wind\n• Zhalia Moon\n\nTrivia\n\n• On the Hyperstride card, Dante's legs are covered in a fiery orange aura instead of blue as seen in the show.\n\nInternational Names\n\nDutch: Hypersprong\nFrench: Hyper-saut\nPortuguese: Hiper-salto\n\nnl:Hypersprong","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S1E17_Lok_Hyperstride.png\n| aura  = Blue\n| class = Mobility\n| users = [[Casterwill family]]<br> [[Huntik Foundation]]<br>[[Suits]]<br>[[Wind]]\n| first = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"\n}}\n'''Hyperstride''' is a basic spell and considered to be mandatory for [[Seekers]]. The spell increases the casters speed and agility allowing them to run quickly for escapes and to strike quickly while in combat. As a result, this spell can also increase the distance that the caster can jump. The spell manifests itself as a blue aura that surrounds the casters legs.\n\n== History ==\nThis spell was cast silently by [[DeFoe|DeFoe's]] [[Suits]] as they chased after [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] in the streets of [[Venice, Italy]]. [[Dante Vale]] later silently cast this spell in the courtyard of his [[Dante Vale's house|house]] before invoking [[Caliban]]. {{source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nDante used this spell whilst carrying Lok on the rooftops of his [[Dante Vale's house|house]] during their escape from [[The Organization]]. The [[Suits]] followed suite, using Hyperstride to leap from roof to roof in pursuit of the pair. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}\n\nLok learnt the spell whilst climbing the walls of the [[Cathedral of Notre Dame]] but did not use enough energy and nearly fell. Luckily Dante caught him. Later, he succeeded in using the spell to dodge an attack from the [[Knights of Arc's Inner Circle]]. {{source|Crawling the Catacombs}} \n\n[[Focauld Casterwill]] used this spell in the [[Cloisters]] to escape into the darkness and hide from [[Kiel]], [[Marduk]] and the [[Blood Spiral]] [[Casterwill Hunters]]. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n\nThis spell was cast by [[Dante Vale]] on his [[Caliban]] to help push the boat. {{source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}\n\n== Users ==\n*[[Dante Vale]]\n*[[Dellix]]\n*[[Den Fears]]\n*[[Focauld Casterwill]]\n*[[Lok Lambert]] \n*[[Lane]]\n*[[Lucas Casterwill]]\n*[[Santiago]]\n*[[Sophie Casterwill]]\n*[[Suits]]\n*[[Viktor Casterwill]]\n*[[Wind]]\n*[[Zhalia Moon]]\n\n{{Clear}}\n== Trivia ==\n* On the [[TCG:SAS-110|Hyperstride]] card, Dante's legs are covered in a fiery orange aura instead of blue as seen in the show.\n\n== International Names ==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|DUT= Hypersprong\n|FR = Hyper-saut\n|POR = Hiper-salto\n}}\n\n\n[[nl:Hypersprong]]\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Mobility spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family magic]]","categories":["Blue-aura spells","Casterwill family magic","Huntik Foundation magic","Magic","Mobility spells","Organization magic"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:3280","status":"resolved","target_title":"Casterwill family","label":"Casterwill family","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_family","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3280"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1987","status":"resolved","target_title":"Huntik Foundation","label":"Huntik Foundation","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Huntik_Foundation","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1987"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3456","status":"resolved","target_title":"Wind","label":"Wind","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Wind","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3456"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2257","status":"resolved","target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1997","status":"resolved","target_title":"Seekers","label":"Seekers","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Seekers","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1997"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2048","status":"resolved","target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe's","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1983","status":"resolved","target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2041","status":"resolved","target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8056","status":"resolved","target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Venice%2C_Italy","href":"#/categories?name=Venice%2C%20Italy"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2006","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2663","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dante Vale's house","label":"house","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale%27s_house","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2663"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2107","status":"resolved","target_title":"Caliban","label":"Caliban","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Caliban","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2107"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2663","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dante Vale's house","label":"house","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale%27s_house","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2663"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2544","status":"resolved","target_title":"Cathedral of Notre Dame","label":"Cathedral of Notre Dame","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Cathedral_of_Notre_Dame","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2544"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2740","status":"resolved","target_title":"Knights of Arc's Inner Circle","label":"Knights of Arc's Inner Circle","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Knights_of_Arc%27s_Inner_Circle","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2740"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4514","status":"resolved","target_title":"Focauld Casterwill","label":"Focauld Casterwill","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Focauld_Casterwill","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4514"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:15038","status":"resolved","target_title":"Cloisters","label":"Cloisters","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Cloisters","hr